Position: UX Designer
Company: PixelCraft Studio
Location: Remote

PixelCraft Studio is looking for a UX Designer to craft intuitive user
experiences for our mobile and web products. You will conduct user
research, create wireframes, and collaborate closely with product and
engineering teams.

Requirements: 3+ years of UX design experience, proficiency in Figma, and a
strong portfolio.

